 Blood Spiral","label":"The Blood Spiral","target_id":"huntik:page:7128","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Blood_Spiral","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A7128"}]}],"start":0,"end":170}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"All new Blood Spiral recruits would be taught this spell as their first power. {{Source|Den vs Harrison}} [[Tantras]] taught the spell to [[Harrison Fears]] and the other orphans at [[Rotterdam Orphanage]]. {{source|Den vs Harrison}}","text":"All new Blood Spiral recruits would be taught this spell as their first power. [Den vs Harrison] Tantras taught the spell to Harrison Fears and the other orphans at Rotterdam Orphanage. [Den vs Harrison]"},{"heading":"Users","level":2,"wikitext":"* [[Bruno]] {{Source|S2E33}}\n* [[Casterwill Hunters]] {{source|Words from Eathon}}\n* [[Dirk]] {{Source|S2E33}}\n* [[Harrison Fears]] {{source|Den vs Harrison}}\n* [[Kiel]] {{source|The Casterwill Connection}}\n* [[Marduk]] {{source|The Casterwill Connection}}\n* [[Rassimov]] {{source|Rassimov's Secret}}\n* [[Silent Soldiers]] {{source|The Blood Spiral}}\n* [[Tantras]] {{source|Den vs Harrison}}\n* [[The Betrayer]] {{source|Dante's Return}}\n* [[Zhalia Moon]] {{source|Lok's Leadership}}","text":"* Bruno [S2E33]\n* Casterwill Hunters [Words from Eathon]\n* Dirk [S2E33]\n* Harrison Fears [Den vs Harrison]\n* Kiel [The Casterwill Connection]\n* Marduk [The Casterwill Connection]\n* Rassimov [Rassimov's Secret]\n* Silent Soldiers [The Blood Spiral]\n* Tantras [Den vs Harrison]\n* The Betrayer [Dante's Return]\n* Zhalia Moon [Lok's Leadership]"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Annule-sort\n|DUT=Nulvloek|POR=Poder Maldito}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Red-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]","text":"French: Annule-sort\nDutch: Nulvloek\nPortuguese: Poder Maldito"}],"full_text":"Nullcurse is the signature spell of the Silent Soldiers in the Blood Spiral. This spell creates a bolt of blood-red energy that can be fired from the hand or used for close combat. It is one of few known spells to be able break through the Casterwill family's Honorguard spell.\n\n== History ==\nAll new Blood Spiral recruits would be taught this spell as their first power. [Den vs Harrison] Tantras taught the spell to Harrison Fears and the other orphans at Rotterdam Orphanage. [Den vs Harrison]\n\n== Users ==\n* Bruno [S2E33]\n* Casterwill Hunters [Words from Eathon]\n* Dirk [S2E33]\n* Harrison Fears [Den vs Harrison]\n* Kiel [The Casterwill Connection]\n* Marduk [The Casterwill Connection]\n* Rassimov [Rassimov's Secret]\n* Silent Soldiers [The Blood Spiral]\n* Tantras [Den vs Harrison]\n* The Betrayer [Dante's Return]\n* Zhalia Moon [Lok's Leadership]\n\n==International Names==","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox spell\n| image = File:S2E37_Silent_Soldier_Nullcurse.png\n| aura  = Red\n| class = Offensive\n| users = [[Blood Spiral]] members\n| first = \"[[The Blood Spiral]]\"\n}}\n'''Nullcurse''' is the signature spell of the [[Silent Soldiers]] in the [[Blood Spiral]]. This spell creates a bolt of blood-red energy that can be fired from the hand or used for close combat. It is one of few known spells to be able break through the [[Casterwill family]]'s [[Honorguard]] spell.\n\n== History ==\nAll new Blood Spiral recruits would be taught this spell as their first power. {{Source|Den vs Harrison}} [[Tantras]] taught the spell to [[Harrison Fears]] and the other orphans at [[Rotterdam Orphanage]]. {{source|Den vs Harrison}}\n\n== Users ==\n* [[Bruno]] {{Source|S2E33}}\n* [[Casterwill Hunters]] {{source|Words from Eathon}}\n* [[Dirk]] {{Source|S2E33}}\n* [[Harrison Fears]] {{source|Den vs Harrison}}\n* [[Kiel]] {{source|The Casterwill Connection}}\n* [[Marduk]] {{source|The Casterwill Connection}}\n* [[Rassimov]] {{source|Rassimov's Secret}}\n* [[Silent Soldiers]] {{source|The Blood Spiral}}\n* [[Tantras]] {{source|Den vs Harrison}}\n* [[The Betrayer]] {{source|Dante's Return}}\n* [[Zhalia Moon]] {{source|Lok's Leadership}}\n\n==International Names==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Annule-sort\n|DUT=Nulvloek|POR=Poder Maldito}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Red-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]","categories":["Blood Spiral magic","Magic","Offensive spells","Red-aura spells"],"links":[{"target_title":"Blood Spiral","label":"Blood Spiral","target_id":"huntik:page:3288","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Blood_Spiral","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3288"},{"target_title":"The Blood Spiral","label":"The Blood Spiral","target_id":"huntik:page:7128","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Blood_Spiral","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A7128"},{"target_title":"Silent Soldiers","label":"Silent Soldiers","target_id":"huntik:page:4383","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Silent_Soldiers","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4383"},{"target_title":"Blood Spiral","label":"Blood Spiral","target_id":"huntik:page:3288","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Blood_Spiral","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3288"},{"target_title":"Casterwill family","label":"Casterwill family","target_id":"huntik:page:3280","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Casterwill_family","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3280"},{"target_title":"Honorguard","label":"Honorguard","target_id":"huntik:page:2094","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Honorguard","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2094"},{"target_title":"Tantras","label":"Tantras","target_id":"huntik:page:4559","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Tantras","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4559"},{"target_title":"Harrison Fears","label":"Harrison Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4446","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Harri